 'Host Creature — Horse', 'Host Creature — Human Fish', 'Host Creature — Jellyfish', 'Host Creature — Kangaroo', 'Host Creature — Lizard', 'Host Creature — Octopus Rigger', 'Host Creature — Pangolin Beast', 'Host Creature — Rat', 'Host Creature — Scorpion', 'Host Creature — Snake', 'Instant', 'Land', 'Legendary Artifact', 'Legendary Creature', 'Legendary Creature — Brainiac Villain', 'Legendary Creature — Goblin Warrior', 'Legendary Creature — Human Gamer', 'Legendary Creature — Human Spy', 'Legendary Creature — Human Villain', 'Legendary Creature — Zombie Villain', 'Legendary Planeswalker — Urza', 'Sorcery', 'instant']
